From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 13:40:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Featured Properties + Vacation Rentals sections after
 testimonials

Replicates the old site's layout: two independent tabbed grids (Featured
Properties: All/For Sale/Sold Investment Properties, Vacation Rentals:
All/Central Texas/Northern Virginia/The Poconos PA) sitting between the
testimonial carousel and the contact form.

lib/wp.ts now splits property listings into two groups instead of one
combined list, with real fallback data (all 20 listings, copied once from
production's Portfolio plugin) replacing the previously-empty array. A
live wp-admin entry routes to the right group/tab automatically based on
its listing_status taxonomy slug, same as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
